'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

== Acquisition ==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|cosmetic set]], found on page one of the [[Castellan’s Creed Legendary Warbond|Castellan’s Creed]] Legendary [[Warbond]], can be claimed for {{Currency|Medals|8|notext}} and 2 [[Medal]]s, respectively.

== Trivia ==
* The symbol on the top right of the player card is that of the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2212-48/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Cadian_Gate Cadian Gate], denoting a large area around [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1105-2154-43/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Cadia Cadia]. The symbol is commonly used as an "honorific badge", showing the wearer fought on Cadia during the time of the [https://megalodon.jp/2026-1106-0003-57/https://warhammer40k.wiki.gg:443/wiki/Black_Crusade Black Crusades].
* Both the cape and the player card are a reference to the camo cloaks used by the marksman in Kasrkin teams.

